Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:05.30,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think she was the main ingredient, you know.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我想 她才是最重要的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:09.06,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7{\fs68}月{\fs78}11{\fs68}日 诺斯科娃在温网登顶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:10.44,TL,,0,0,0,,但她的年终之路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:12.65,TL,,0,0,0,,还要从一月讲起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:15.95,TL,,0,0,0,,布里斯班 澳网 都止步第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:18.32,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网两盘负于王欣瑜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:21.20,TL,,0,0,0,,多哈 迪拜 都是第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:42.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was tricky circumstances for her today.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她今天面对的局面相当棘手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:45.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Challenging conditions.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N条件充满挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.69,0:00:49.13,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}月 她在印第安维尔斯打进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.13,0:00:52.70,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 对面是世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:01.14,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}For the third time in her career,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是她生涯第三次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:04.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Aryna Sabalenka is in the Indian Wells final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N萨巴伦卡打进印第安维尔斯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:09.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she's done it in back-to-back years.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而且连续两年做到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:12.98,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Still yet to drop a set in this tournament.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N本届比赛 她仍未丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.66,0:01:15.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another emphatic performance,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又一场强势的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:17.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}full of power and precision.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N充满力量与精准
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.93,0:01:19.47,TL,,0,0,0,,迈阿密首战失利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.47,0:01:21.64,TL,,0,0,0,,斯图加特打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.64,0:01:25.63,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里 她抢七击败高芙 晋级{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:35.37,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Put it in the books.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N记下这一胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.37,0:01:37.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A dozen top-ten wins{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第十二次击败世界前十
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.65,0:01:41.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}earns the 21-year-old from Czechia a spot{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N让二十一岁的捷克姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:43.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in her 21st WTA quarterfinal,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第{\fs78}21{\fs68}次进入巡回赛{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:45.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and her first in Madrid.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这也是她首进马德里{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.05,0:01:48.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as Linda Noskova knocks off{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N诺斯科娃击败了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.41,0:01:50.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}last year's runner-up Coco Gauff,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N去年的亚军高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:52.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in three dynamic sets,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N三盘激战之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:55.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}holding on to her one-set lead{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她守住先赢一盘的优势
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.35,0:02:00.85,TL,,0,0,550,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to move through, 6-4, 1-6, 7-6.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}晋级
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.16,0:02:03.22,TL,,0,0,0,,随后 她负于科斯秋克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.22,0:02:04.67,TL,,0,0,0,,止步马德里{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.67,0:02:06.61,TL,,0,0,0,,罗马止步第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:07.62,TL,,0,0,0,,法网首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.62,0:02:11.17,TL,,0,0,0,,又以{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}负于萨卡里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:14.37,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}26{\fs68}天后 故事转向草地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.37,0:02:17.03,TL,,0,0,0,,柏林决赛 她{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘击败佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.03,0:02:20.39,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到本季首冠 也是生涯第二冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:33.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A spectacular week in Berlin{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N精彩绝伦的柏林一周
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:37.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}ends with tears of joy for Linda Noskova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以诺斯科娃喜极而泣收尾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:40.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's been a bit of a wait{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这场等待 有些漫长
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.67,0:02:42.37,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for her second career title,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的生涯第二冠终于到来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.37,0:02:45.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but she gets it on the grass in Germany{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她在德国的草地上夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:48.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}at the expense of the former champion Jessica Pegula.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N击败的是前冠军佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:50.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another classic between these two.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两人又奉献了一场经典
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.93,0:02:54.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But in the end, it's the serve and first-strike tennis{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最终 是发球和第一拍进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.33,0:02:56.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}of Linda Noskova that gets her home.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N让诺斯科娃笑到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.39,0:03:00.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a relief she will feel,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她一定会感到如释重负
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:06.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}after those almost-but-not-quite moments of last year,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N去年 她曾多次功亏一篑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.55,0:03:09.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}when she made three finals but couldn't get it done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N三次进决赛 却都没能夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.15,0:03:12.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She has here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一次 她做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.49,0:03:15.92,TL,,0,0,0,,巴特洪堡首轮出局后 她来到温网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:18.76,TL,,0,0,0,,跨过凯斯 梅尔滕斯和科斯秋克
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:21.18,TL,,0,0,0,,她首次打进大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:24.18,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一关 是朋友穆霍娃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:33.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's over and out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.59,0:03:36.32,TL,,0,0,0,,北美夏天 多伦多首战出局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:38.66,TL,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提止步第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:41.16,TL,,0,0,0,,美网 她第一次打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:42.84,TL,,0,0,0,,再次面对萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:46.04,TL,,0,0,0,,胜负直到决胜盘抢{\fs78}10{\fs68}才揭晓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.14,0:03:57.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The world number one,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.26,0:04:00.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}stretched to the limit in New York,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在纽约被逼到了极限
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:03.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but eventually prevails{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但最终还是胜出
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:09.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to take out the Wimbledon champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N淘汰了温网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:12.84,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's 18 straight wins now in the Big Apple{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她在纽约已取得十八连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:15.14,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for Aryna Sabalenka,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她是萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:19.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}who returns once more to the last four.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又一次回到了美网{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.65,0:04:22.96,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月 她帮助捷克夺得比利简金杯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:24.68,TL,,0,0,0,,北京止步第四轮后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:26.29,TL,,0,0,0,,北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}9{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.29,0:04:28.93,TL,,0,0,0,,官方确认她首次入围年终
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.93,0:04:32.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}11{\fs68}日 她因左小腿受伤退出武汉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.22,0:04:35.08,TL,,0,0,0,,温网夺冠后的晚宴上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:37.30,TL,,0,0,0,,她把感谢留给母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:41.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think she was the main ingredient, you know.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我想 她才是最重要的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:43.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Like I said in the speech,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N正如我在致辞中说的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:46.32,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I would not be there without any of my parents,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N没有父母 就不会有今天的我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:48.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}or without my team,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还有我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:50.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and without everyone supporting me in my journey,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N和一路支持我的所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:53.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}so it was a mix of everybody.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是大家一起成就了这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:56.77,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次年终 她会带来怎样的惊喜？
